    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton manager that controls the model-view mode toggles (Normal vs 1:1 scale). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Exposes OnNormalViewToggle and OnOneToOneViewToggle events that other systems subscribe to in order to react to view-mode changes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
